      "role": "user",
      "content": "just finished a 14 hour shift. another night of just... patching people up only for them to end up back here or worse a week later. it feels like i'm just trying to empty the ocean with a fucking spoon. i'm so tired of the cycle. everything just feels so heavy and pointless.",
